[Script Info]
; Created by Andy Charlie W. (ambilixer) in collaboration with Claude (Anthropic).
;
; btk_styles.ass: the Main and BG lyric styles, and nothing else. Import them
; into a track's _subs-timed.ass with Aegisub's Style Manager (see HOWTO.md)
; before running the Karaoke Formatting v2 macro. check_styles.py compares a
; finished track's styles against these values.
Title: bayshore-trap-karaoke lyric styles
ScriptType: v4.00+
WrapStyle: 0
ScaledBorderAndShadow: yes
YCbCr Matrix: TV.709
PlayResX: 1920
PlayResY: 1080

